              "{\"headline\":\"China says its economy is slowing. Its central bank may be preparing to intervene\",\"dateCreated\":\"2018-10-01T06:35:34+0000\",\"datePublished\":\"2018-10-01T06:35:34+0000\",\"dateModified\":\"2018-10-01T07:49:57+0000\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Huileng Tan\"}],\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"CNBC\",\"foundingDate\":\"1989-04-17\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.instagram.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cnbc\",\"https://twitter.com/cnbc\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNBC\",\"https://www.youtube.com/cnbc\"]},\"articleSection\":\"China Economy\",\"keywords\":[\"cnbc\",\"Articles\",\"Trade\",\"Business\",\"Central banking\",\"World economy\",\"United States\",\"Beijing\",\"China\",\"Asia News\",\"Markets\",\"Asia Economy\",\"World Economy\",\"Central Banks\",\"People's Bank of China\",\"Business News\",\"China Economy\",\"source:tagname:CNBC Asia Source\"],\"video\":{\"description\":\"Jeff Ng, head of Asia research at Continuum Economics, says he expects China's economic growth to slow slightly in the coming quarters as a result of the trade row.\",\"duration\":\"PT1M56S\",\"name\":\"Chinese growth expected to slow slightly in coming quarters: Analyst\",\"uploadDate\":\"2018-10-01T00:14:56+0000\"}}"
